!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/valid/an-extern-of-a-record-is-a-member-of-a-reference-over-record-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.13"
  description: """
    A reference over a constructor admits an extern where the foreign entry's constructor is that constructor or
    IS-A it, judged by identity: both schemas hold one kernel, so `meta.ref<meta.record>` admits an extern of a
    record and `meta.ref<numeric.integer_type>` an extern of an integer refinement.
    """
  valid: {
    binds: [holder]
  }
}
